{"3168520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BloomTale", "steam_appid": 3168520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>BloomTale</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/42609dae6564ba1a5e917426d47c03b9.avif?t=1779258512\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>BloomTale</strong>, where your creativity blossoms as you run your very own flower shop. Each flower carries a unique meaning, and your mission is to master the language of flowers by crafting thoughtful arrangements that reflect your customers’ feelings. Tend to your blooms, customize your shop, and watch your reputation grow and flourish with every bouquet.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/2c7bf0fcc6324052081533f55ac433f8.avif?t=1779258512\" width=620 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers are more than just decoration. Each bloom carries its own meaning, letting you craft bouquets that symbolize love, hope, apology, or even luck. Mix and match flowers, colors, wraps, ribbons, and decorations to create arrangements with a truly personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.poster.avif?t=1779258512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.webm?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.mp4?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/40507d3f94910980855c66f75b99d4a0.avif?t=1779258512\" width=620 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 15 unique customers, each with their own story and a little bit of whimsy. Pick flowers or craft bouquets to match their requests and enjoy watching their personalities grow with each visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.poster.avif?t=1779258512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.webm?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.mp4?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8c9314e7a807fd9ab4b3f4978babde6b.avif?t=1779258512\" width=620 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your shop grows, so does the world around it. Unlock visual upgrades, personalize your home, and create a space that matches your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.poster.avif?t=1779258512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.webm?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.mp4?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/9d06571004b0ef31d224359d04e8531e.avif?t=1779258512\" width=620 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 50 unique flowers, each with its own meaning, and fill your magical garden with vibrant blooms. Keep your garden happy and discover tiny visitors wandering among your flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.poster.avif?t=1779258512\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.webm?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8fc20bc860b85b8f106135ec0b694492.mp4?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>BloomTale</strong>, where your creativity blossoms as you run your very own flower shop. Each flower carries a unique meaning, and your mission is to master the language of flowers by crafting thoughtful arrangements that reflect your customers’ feelings. Tend to your blooms, customize your shop, and watch your reputation grow and flourish with every bouquet.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/2c7bf0fcc6324052081533f55ac433f8.avif?t=1779258512\" width=620 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers are more than just decoration. Each bloom carries its own meaning, letting you craft bouquets that symbolize love, hope, apology, or even luck. Mix and match flowers, colors, wraps, ribbons, and decorations to create arrangements with a truly personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.poster.avif?t=1779258512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.webm?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/31b908fac458f11ce2ba37aa896a3e0a.mp4?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/40507d3f94910980855c66f75b99d4a0.avif?t=1779258512\" width=620 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 15 unique customers, each with their own story and a little bit of whimsy. Pick flowers or craft bouquets to match their requests and enjoy watching their personalities grow with each visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.poster.avif?t=1779258512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.webm?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/3390ed617c380e7723b4180303841326.mp4?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/8c9314e7a807fd9ab4b3f4978babde6b.avif?t=1779258512\" width=620 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your shop grows, so does the world around it. Unlock visual upgrades, personalize your home, and create a space that matches your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.poster.avif?t=1779258512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.webm?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168520/extras/331d99381e718a77c9f954dc22374718.mp4?t=1779258512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht